  "content_type": "text",
  "content": "# PostgreSQL Slow Query Review",
  "speaker": null,
  "confidence": 0.86,
  "tags": [
    "heading"
  ],
  "evidence_id": "2c13daad-4b7b-472d-b392-e56f92660bb7"
},
{
  "asset_id": "6b8dd7be-e3bd-42dd-8ff2-552292e52f69",
  "span_ref": "paragraph:0002",
  "content_type": "text",
  "content": "## Context",
  "speaker": null,
  "confidence": 0.86,
  "tags": [
    "heading"
  ],
  "evidence_id": "ad5df780-f101-4de3-9a8d-331d79c5f39a"
},
{
  "asset_id": "6b8dd7be-e3bd-42dd-8ff2-552292e52f69",
  "span_ref": "paragraph:0003",
  "content_type": "text",
  "content": "This note captures a repeatable way to review slow SQL queries before blindly adding indexes.",
  "speaker": null,
  "confidence": 0.86,
  "tags": [],
  "evidence_id": "e99975e5-1457-4958-b760-e422e24620c3"
},
{
  "asset_id": "6b8dd7be-e3bd-42dd-8ff2-552292e52f69",
  "span_ref": "paragraph:0004",
  "content_type": "text",
  "content": "## Procedure",
  "speaker": null,
  "confidence": 0.86,
  "tags": [
    "heading"
  ],
  "evidence_id": "89649571-0e2e-4773-a42a-787c61a71e8b"
},
{
  "asset_id": "6b8dd7be-e3bd-42dd-8ff2-552292e52f69",
  "span_ref": "paragraph:0005",
  "content_type": "text",
  "content": "1. Capture the worst queries from `pg_stat_statements`.\n2. Run `EXPLAIN ANALYZE` and compare the actual plan with the expected access path.\n3. Measure whether the bottleneck is I/O, CPU, or lock contention.",
  "speaker": null,
  "confidence": 0.86,
  "tags": [],
  "evidence_id": "117420a9-9b19-4189-8664-e711c03b7207"
},
{
  "asset_id": "6b8dd7be-e3bd-42dd-8ff2-552292e52f69",
  "span_ref": "paragraph:0006",
  "content_type": "text",
  "content": "## Rules",
  "speaker": null,
  "confidence": 0.86,
  "tags": [
    "heading"
  ],
  "evidence_id": "eb4db591-cc97-4e2d-b994-1bf78250830b"
},
{
  "asset_id": "6b8dd7be-e3bd-42dd-8ff2-552292e52f69",
  "span_ref": "paragraph:0007",
  "content_type": "text",
  "content": "If the query is I/O bound, review index coverage before rewriting business logic.\nIf row estimates diverge sharply from actual rows, inspect stale statistics.",
  "speaker": null,
  "confidence": 0.86,
  "tags": [],
  "evidence_id": "616e1a80-bfa1-416c-929a-bdd0c5752dfc"
},
{
  "asset_id": "6b8dd7be-e3bd-42dd-8ff2-552292e52f69",
  "span_ref": "paragraph:0008",
  "content_type": "text",
  "content": "## Anti-patterns",
  "speaker": null,
  "confidence": 0.86,
  "tags": [
    "heading"
  ],
  "evidence_id": "4634db72-def8-414f-9a5d-e0f691060336"
},
{
  "asset_id": "6b8dd7be-e3bd-42dd-8ff2-552292e52f69",
  "span_ref": "paragraph:0009",
  "content_type": "text",
  "content": "Avoid adding overlapping indexes without calculating write amplification.\nDo not change the query text and the index strategy at the same time.",
  "speaker": null,
  "confidence": 0.86,
  "tags": [],
  "evidence_id": "a9457bf8-9364-42d4-ab82-2db14fcc36e8"
},
{
  "asset_id": "6b8dd7be-e3bd-42dd-8ff2-552292e52f69",
  "span_ref": "paragraph:0010",
  "content_type": "text",
  "content": "## Verification",
  "speaker": null,
  "confidence": 0.86,
  "tags": [
    "heading"
  ],
  "evidence_id": "b031dbc7-63dc-4d16-8de4-19a5286774b7"
},
{
  "asset_id": "6b8dd7be-e3bd-42dd-8ff2-552292e52f69",
  "span_ref": "paragraph:0011",
  "content_type": "text",
  "content": "Verify the fix by comparing latency, buffer hits, and row estimates before and after the change.",
  "speaker": null,
  "confidence": 0.86,
  "tags": [],
  "evidence_id": "f7b9f626-437d-4cf9-b470-e4660a0dcc1d"
}
]
